ubject for future  videos being able to choose or ask  questions for Q&amp;A videos or live streams  I will be doing as well as exclusive  access to behind-the-scenes footage or  other uploads I will be doing and  previews on future videos not to mention  a more private discussion with me and  other members of the patron community so  if you choose to support me further and  to allow me to continue to do these  videos with frequency and with an  increasing quality I would of course be  very highly grateful so as I said I will  leave a link in description and you can  check it out for yourselves hopefully we  can together increase the religious  literacy on YouTube or in the discussion  on religion in the world generally and I  will also like to take this opportunity  to thank you all so much for your  continual support I'll see you in the  next video
 

